!
! This test calculates the energy and some propertiest
! of the dichloroethane molecule in different geometries.
! Note that we consistently leave out the SS integrals
! by using the LVCORR option in the general section.
!
**DIRAC
.TITLE
1,2-dichloroethane. Restricted kinetic balance. Energies, properties.
.WAVE F
.PROPER
**HAMILTONIAN
.LVCORR
**WAVE FUNCTIONS
.DHF
.RELCCSD
*DHFCAL
.EVCCNV
1.0E-8
**PROPERTIES
.DIPOLE
.QUADRUPOLE
.NQCC
*END OF

 &RELCCSD TIMING=T, DOENER=T &END
 &CCENER DOMP2=T, DOCCSD=T, DOCCSDT=T &END

